        "parms": "# capture — what went past\nA capture records every value that reaches it and sends nothing. A list is recorded as one item per element. dump sends the record, oldest first, one item at a time. When the record is full, each new item pushes the oldest out, so it always holds the latest. This one holds 4 items; the most, and the default, is 512.\nUnlike Max, there is no window showing the record, and it cannot be written to a file: use textfile for that.",
